        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Lee Erwin\n- Characters: Morris the Cat, He-Man\n- Brands: 9Lives\n- Topics: voice acting, advertising mascots\n\nFacts:\n- John Lee Erwin was born on December 5, 1936.\n- John Lee Erwin is an American voice actor.\n- John Lee Erwin is known for voicing Morris the Cat and He-Man.\n- Morris the Cat is voiced by John Lee Erwin.\n- Morris the Cat is the advertising mascot for 9Lives brand cat food.\n- Morris the Cat appears on 9Lives packaging and in many 9Lives television commercials.",
